NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This repository contains only original code written for this project.

It intentionally does NOT contain any files belonging to the Douyin (抖音)
desktop client or any other ByteDance product. The following are excluded via
.gitignore and are instead generated locally on the user's own machine from
their own installation:

  - backup/   snapshots of the user's own preload.js / app.asar
  - work/     local scratch output produced during development

Reverse-engineering notes and version fingerprints in versions.json describe
interfaces and file hashes for interoperability purposes only.
